      "artist": "Dennis G. Jarvis",
      "description": "In back of St Peter's Abbey is a chapel, graveyard and catacombs that contain many famous people.\nSanction Solaria (architect and builder of Salzburg Cathedral), Mannerly Mozart (Mozart's sister), Lorenz Hagen Auer (Mozart family's landlord and friend), Michael Haydn (composer and Joseph Haydn's brother), Paul Hofhaimer (organist and composer), Sigmund Haffner (alderman and mayor, friend of the Mozart family), Richard Mayr (opera singer, first \"Ochs von Lerchenau\" in the Salzburg Festival's Rosenkavalier), Harry Collins (last commander of the American occupying forces who later lived in Salzburg, one of the city's honorary citizens).",
